{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01La5penZ77koUxaRoKaoJmS","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 原始framing完全成立——'Structured error injection is fundamentally destabilizing\n2\t  for embodied planning across architectures'。论文贡献从negative result升级为positive finding\n3\t  about injection stability properties。重点：(1)跨模型SD ratio 4:1证明是structured patterns的内在属性；(2)dose-response\n4\t  inverted-U揭示conflicting signal mechanism；(3)recovery=resilience是对整个error-injection-for-recovery范式的conceptual\n5\t  challenge。无需调整claims强度。\n6\timagined_experiments:\n7\t- name: Recovery Eval Multi-Seed (5-seed × 3 conditions)\n8\t  plan_id: recovery-eval-multiseed\n9\t  description: 对Vanilla/TaxEI/Random全部5个seed运行recovery eval（injected error条件下47 tasks），验证recovery≈resilience假说跨seed稳健性，并确认per-operator\n10\t    pattern方向一致性\n11\t  expected_results:\n12\t    vanilla_recovery_mean: 66.1\n13\t    vanilla_recovery_sd: 5.4\n14\t    vanilla_recovery_seeds:\n15\t    - 61.7\n16\t    - 68.1\n17\t    - 66.0\n18\t    - 66.0\n19\t    - 74.5\n20\t    taxei_recovery_mean: 57.1\n21\t    taxei_recovery_sd: 6.8\n22\t    taxei_recovery_seeds:\n23\t    - 59.6\n24\t    - 46.8\n25\t    - 61.7\n26\t    - 61.7\n27\t    - 57.4\n28\t    random_recovery_mean: 57.9\n29\t    random_recovery_sd: 7.2\n30\t    random_recovery_seeds:\n31\t    - 63.8\n32\t    - 55.3\n33\t    - 66.0\n34\t    - 51.1\n35\t    - 53.2\n36\t    detection_rate_all: 0.0\n37\t    recovery_vs_clean_gap_vanilla_pp: 1.2\n38\t    recovery_vs_clean_gap_taxei_pp: 1.2\n39\t    recovery_vs_clean_gap_random_pp: 0.4\n40\t    per_operator_C4_advantage_replication: 3\n41\t    per_operator_C4_advantage_out_of: 5\n42\t    cohens_d_vanilla_vs_taxei_recovery: 1.42\n43\t  result_rationale: 在best档位下，recovery=resilience pattern跨seed完全复现。逻辑：如果模型只是passively\n44\t    ignore perturbation而非actively recover，那么recovery rate应该tracking clean eval rate而非独立变化。5-seed数据将使recovery-clean\n45\t    gap压缩到1-2pp以内（在noise范围内），因为每个seed的recovery rate本质上就是该seed对应checkpoint的task completion\n46\t    ability在稍有噪声的eval条件下的测量值。Detection rate保持0%说明没有任何training regime instill error\n47\t    awareness。TaxEI的recovery variance同样高（SD~6.8pp），mirror其clean eval的instability——进一步证明recovery\n48\t    performance完全由base task competence驱动，而非error-specific learning。Vanilla recovery\n49\t    mean（66.1%）vs clean mean（67.3%）gap仅1.2pp，在47-task的McNemar误差范围内。\n50\t  tables:\n51\t  - title: 'Table: 5-Seed Recovery Rate vs Clean Success Rate'\n52\t    columns:\n53\t    - Condition\n54\t    - Clean_Mean\n55\t    - Recovery_Mean\n56\t    - Gap_pp\n57\t    - Detection_Rate\n58\t    - Recovery_SD\n59\t    rows:\n60\t    - - Vanilla\n61\t      - 67.3\n62\t      - 66.1\n63\t      - -1.2\n64\t      - 0.0\n65\t      - 5.4\n66\t    - - TaxEI\n67\t      - 58.3\n68\t      - 57.1\n69\t      - -1.2\n70\t      - 0.0\n71\t      - 6.8\n72\t    - - Random\n73\t      - 58.3\n74\t      - 57.9\n75\t      - -0.4\n76\t      - 0.0\n77\t      - 7.2\n78\t  - title: 'Table: Per-Operator Recovery Advantage (5-seed pooled, 235 episodes)'\n79\t    columns:\n80\t    - Operator\n81\t    - Vanilla_Rate\n82\t    - TaxEI_Rate\n83\t    - Random_Rate\n84\t    - TaxEI_Advantage_pp\n85\t    rows:\n86\t    - - C4_observation_masking\n87\t      - 0.618\n88\t      - 0.655\n89\t      - 0.6\n90\t      - 3.7\n91\t    - - P1_step_order_swap\n92\t      - 0.617\n93\t      - 0.6\n94\t      - 0.6\n95\t      - -1.7\n96\t    - - C1_context_truncation\n97\t      - 0.7\n98\t      - 0.633\n99\t      - 0.65\n100\t      - -6.7\n101\t    - - P2_sub_goal_deletion\n102\t      - 0.667\n103\t      - 0.55\n104\t      - 0.583\n105\t      - -11.7\n106\t  figures_description:\n107\t  - 'Scatter plot: x=clean success rate per seed, y=recovery rate per seed. Three\n108\t    colors for V/T/R. 应落在y=x对角线附近（r²>0.92），视觉上证明recovery=f(competence)而非recovery=f(training_method)'\n109\t  - 'Per-operator heatmap: rows=4 operators, columns=5 seeds, cell color=TaxEI recovery\n110\t    rate. C4行uniformly lighter（higher），P2行darker（lower），跨seed一致'\n111\t  analysis: 5-seed recovery data将recovery=resilience从single-seed exploratory observation提升为robust\n112\t    empirical finding。关键统计：paired correlation between clean rate and recovery rate\n113\t    r=0.96 (p<0.001, N=15 seed-condition pairs)。这是对整个error-injection-for-recovery\n114\t    paradigm的conceptual challenge——在embodied planning中，'recovery from errors'根本不存在作为独立能力，它就是task\n115\t    competence本身。Per-operator方向性（C4 local advantage, P2 global disadvantage）在5-seed\n116\t    pooled data中达到suggestive consistency（3/5 seeds方向一致），虽然per-seed仍由±1 task驱动，但pooled\n117\t    N=55-60 per operator使pattern更credible。\n118\t- name: LLaMA-3.1-8B Cross-Model Replication\n119\t  plan_id: llama-cross-model\n120\t  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct 3-seed完整replication（Vanilla/TaxEI/Random），验证structured\n121\t    injection instability是跨架构通用现象而非Qwen-specific\n122\t  expected_results:\n123\t    llama_vanilla_recovery_mean: 73.1\n124\t    llama_vanilla_recovery_sd: 2.5\n125\t    llama_vanilla_recovery_seeds:\n126\t    - 74.5\n127\t    - 74.5\n128\t    - 70.2\n129\t    llama_taxei_recovery_mean: 69.5\n130\t    llama_taxei_recovery_sd: 8.6\n131\t    llama_taxei_recovery_seeds:\n132\t    - 74.5\n133\t    - 74.5\n134\t    - 59.6\n135\t    llama_random_recovery_mean: 76.6\n136\t    llama_random_recovery_sd: 2.1\n137\t    llama_random_recovery_seeds:\n138\t    - 74.5\n139\t    - 76.6\n140\t    - 78.7\n141\t    llama_vanilla_clean_mean: 72.3\n142\t    llama_vanilla_clean_sd: 0.0\n143\t    llama_taxei_clean_mean: 71.6\n144\t    llama_taxei_clean_sd: 8.6\n145\t    llama_random_clean_mean: 75.9\n146\t    llama_random_clean_sd: 1.2\n147\t    cross_model_taxei_sd_ratio: 4.1\n148\t    catastrophic_seed_fraction_llama: 0.33\n149\t    taxei_vs_random_sd_ratio: 4.1\n150\t    llama_detection_rate_mean: 0.27\n151\t  result_rationale: 'Best档核心：cross_model_taxei_sd_ratio在[3.5, 4.5]范围内，实际值4.1（TaxEI\n152\t    SD 8.6 / Random SD 2.1）。这个4:1的SD ratio是structured injection创造training instability的直接evidence。为什么会出现：(1)\n153\t    Structured patterns（taxonomy-labeled perturbations）在loss landscape中创造systematic偏移方向，某些seed的初始化恰好与这些bias方向对齐导致catastrophic\n154\t    amplification；(2) Random perturbations平均化为near-zero gradient bias，任何seed都不会被systematically\n155\t    pushed toward failure region。LLaMA s123 collapse（recovery 59.6% vs vanilla 70.2%）mirrors\n156\t    Qwen的consistent degradation pattern但以higher variance形式表现——不同architecture对structured\n157\t    bias的响应mode不同（Qwen: uniform moderate harm; LLaMA: bimodal all-or-nothing），但direction一致。LLaMA的非零detection\n158\t    rate（~27%）是interesting但不影响core story：LLaMA base model本身就有更强的meta-cognitive tendency（可能来自RLHF\n159\t    alignment），这不是training regime effect而是base model property。'\n160\t  tables:\n161\t  - title: 'Table: Cross-Model Comparison — Training Stability'\n162\t    columns:\n163\t    - Model\n164\t    - Condition\n165\t    - Mean_Recovery\n166\t    - SD\n167\t    - Catastrophic_Seeds\n168\t    - SD_Ratio_vs_Random\n169\t    rows:\n170\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n171\t      - TaxEI\n172\t      - 58.3\n173\t      - 6.5\n174\t      - 1/5 (20%)\n175\t      - 0.75×\n176\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n177\t      - Random\n178\t      - 58.3\n179\t      - 8.7\n180\t      - 1/5 (20%)\n181\t      - 1.0×\n182\t    - - LLaMA-3.1-8B\n183\t      - TaxEI\n184\t      - 69.5\n185\t      - 8.6\n186\t      - 1/3 (33%)\n187\t      - 4.1×\n188\t    - - LLaMA-3.1-8B\n189\t      - Random\n190\t      - 76.6\n191\t      - 2.1\n192\t      - 0/3 (0%)\n193\t      - 1.0×\n194\t  - title: 'Table: LLaMA Per-Seed Results'\n195\t    columns:\n196\t    - Seed\n197\t    - Vanilla_Recovery\n198\t    - TaxEI_Recovery\n199\t    - Random_Recovery\n200\t    - TaxEI_Δ_vs_Vanilla\n201\t    rows:\n202\t    - - s42\n203\t      - 74.5\n204\t      - 74.5\n205\t      - 76.6\n206\t      - 0.0\n207\t    - - s0\n208\t      - 74.5\n209\t      - 74.5\n210\t      - 74.5\n211\t      - 0.0\n212\t    - - s123\n213\t      - 70.2\n214\t      - 59.6\n215\t      - 78.7\n216\t      - -10.6\n217\t  figures_description:\n218\t  - 'Dual-panel bar chart: Left=Qwen, Right=LLaMA. Each panel shows V/T/R means with\n219\t    individual seed dots overlaid. Error bars = SD. 视觉上highlight TaxEI的wide spread\n220\t    vs Random的tight cluster'\n221\t  - 'SD ratio comparison: grouped bar chart showing TaxEI_SD/Random_SD for both models.\n222\t    Both bars near 4:1 height ratio. Horizontal dashed line at 1.0 (equal stability)'\n223\t  analysis: 'Cross-model replication是从Borderline Accept升级到Findings Accept的关键evidence。Reviewers最大concern是''maybe\n224\t    it''s just Qwen''——3-seed LLaMA data以方向一致性（而非absolute power）回答这个问题。SD ratio 4.1:1在best档下被接受为sufficient\n225\t    evidence because: (1) direction完全一致——两个模型都是TaxEI unstable, Random stable; (2)\n226\t    具体failure mode不同但可解释——Qwen对structured bias更uniformly susceptible（可能因为较弱的pre-training\n227\t    robustness），LLaMA有stronger base但occasional catastrophic collapse（bimodal response\n228\t    to structured bias）; (3) 3-seed × 2-model = 6 independent TaxEI training runs中2个catastrophic（33%），vs\n229\t    6 Random runs中0个catastrophic（0%）——这个0-vs-2 pattern本身有practical significance even\n230\t    without formal power。'\n231\t- name: Scale-Up Data (500→2500 Trajectories)\n232\t  plan_id: scale-up-data\n233\t  description: 将训练数据从501 successful trajectories扩展到~2500，测试TaxEI failure是否由数据规模不足导致。3-seed\n234\t    V+T比较。\n235\t  expected_results:\n236\t    collection_success_rate: 0.7\n237\t    total_trajectories_collected: 2487\n238\t    api_cost_usd: 44.5\n239\t    scaled_vanilla_mean: 71.2\n240\t    scaled_vanilla_sd: 3.8\n241\t    scaled_vanilla_seeds:\n242\t    - 69.8\n243\t    - 74.5\n244\t    - 69.4\n245\t    scaled_taxei_mean: 62.3\n246\t    scaled_taxei_sd: 7.4\n247\t    scaled_taxei_seeds:\n248\t    - 66.0\n249\t    - 55.3\n250\t    - 65.5\n251\t    vanilla_improvement_vs_500: 3.9\n252\t    taxei_improvement_vs_500: 5.6\n253\t    taxei_vanilla_gap_pp: -8.9\n254\t    taxei_sd_still_elevated: true\n255\t    catastrophic_seed_present: true\n256\t  result_rationale: 在best档下，scale-up证明data volume不是瓶颈。逻辑：(1) Vanilla从67.3%→71.2%（+3.9pp），shows正常data\n257\t    scaling behavior——更多clean data mildly improves task completion; (2) TaxEI也改善，从58.3%→62.3%（+5.6pp，slightly\n258\t    larger margin），但gap仍然是~9pp（在[8,10]范围内）且SD仍elevated（7.4pp vs 3.8pp）; (3) 1/3 seed仍然shows\n259\t    catastrophic behavior（55.3%），证明instability is not a small-data artifact。为什么gap维持：ALFWorld只有~134\n260\t    unique tasks，即使trajectories增加到2500也只是~19/task的重复，无法提供真正的novel task diversity。Structured\n261\t    error patterns在任何data scale下都创造conflicting signals（正确action distribution vs injected\n262\t    error distribution的systematic conflict），不会被averaging out因为taxonomy labels是deterministic\n263\t    not stochastic。这与PALADIN的50K trajectories有qualitative difference：PALADIN的diversity来自thousands\n264\t    of distinct tools/APIs，而ALFWorld diversity ceiling很低。\n265\t  tables:\n266\t  - title: 'Table: Data Scale Ablation (3-seed)'\n267\t    columns:\n268\t    - Scale\n269\t    - Condition\n270\t    - Mean\n271\t    - SD\n272\t    - Gap_vs_Vanilla\n273\t    - Catastrophic_Seeds\n274\t    rows:\n275\t    - - 500 traj (baseline)\n276\t      - Vanilla\n277\t      - 67.3\n278\t      - 4.7\n279\t      - —\n280\t      - 0/5\n281\t    - - 500 traj (baseline)\n282\t      - TaxEI\n283\t      - 58.3\n284\t      - 6.5\n285\t      - -9.0\n286\t      - 1/5\n287\t    - - 2500 traj\n288\t      - Vanilla\n289\t      - 71.2\n290\t      - 3.8\n291\t      - —\n292\t      - 0/3\n293\t    - - 2500 traj\n294\t      - TaxEI\n295\t      - 62.3\n296\t      - 7.4\n297\t      - -8.9\n298\t      - 1/3\n299\t  figures_description:\n300\t  - 'Line plot: x=data scale (500, 2500), y=mean accuracy. Two lines (Vanilla solid,\n301\t    TaxEI dashed). Both rise but gap constant ~9pp. Shaded region = ±1 SD. TaxEI shading\n302\t    notably wider.'\n303\t  analysis: Scale ablation在best档下提供clean negative result：more data helps both conditions\n304\t    proportionally但不关闭gap。这strengthens task-structure hypothesis over data-insufficiency\n305\t    explanation。关键framing：'Within ALFWorld's diversity ceiling (~134 unique tasks),\n306\t    5× data scaling improves absolute performance but does not resolve the structured\n307\t    injection instability, suggesting the failure mechanism is signal-level (conflicting\n308\t    gradients) rather than sample-level (insufficient coverage).' Paper中作为1段Discussion\n309\t    evidence，不需要占main results space。\n310\t- name: Scale Ablation (25K-50K Trajectories)\n311\t  plan_id: scale-ablation\n312\t  description: 假设性的extreme scale experiment——将data规模推到PALADIN级别（25K-50K trajectories）。在best档下，这个experiment如果执行会进一步confirm\n313\t    scale is not the fix。\n314\t  expected_results:\n315\t    trajectories_needed: 25000\n316\t    estimated_api_cost_usd: 250\n317\t    estimated_gpu_hours: 40\n318\t    vanilla_projected_mean: 73.5\n319\t    taxei_projected_mean: 65.2\n320\t    gap_still_present_pp: -8.3\n321\t    taxei_sd_still_elevated: true\n322\t    practical_ceiling_note: ALFWorld only has 134 unique tasks; beyond ~5K trajectories,\n323\t      marginal returns diminish sharply\n324\t  result_rationale: 在best档下，即使25K scale也不会close the gap，因为bottleneck是task diversity（134\n325\t    unique tasks）而非trajectory count。当每个task有~187个trajectory variants时，model只是在memorize同一task的不同表述，而structured\n326\t    injection的conflicting signal per-task-template不会被additional examples resolve。这是best档而非worst档的预测——reviewers接受'we\n327\t    tested 2500 and the trend is clear, 25K is infeasible given ALFWorld constraints\n328\t    but would not help based on the non-convergence pattern'作为sufficient evidence。不需要actually\n329\t    run这个experiment——scale-up-data已经demonstrate the trend。\n330\t  tables:\n331\t  - title: 'Table: Projected Scale-Performance Curve (extrapolation)'\n332\t    columns:\n333\t    - Scale\n334\t    - Vanilla_Proj\n335\t    - TaxEI_Proj\n336\t    - Gap_pp\n337\t    - Diminishing_Returns\n338\t    rows:\n339\t    - - 500\n340\t      - 67.3\n341\t      - 58.3\n342\t      - -9.0\n343\t      - —\n344\t    - - 2500\n345\t      - 71.2\n346\t      - 62.3\n347\t      - -8.9\n348\t      - Vanilla +3.9pp\n349\t    - - 25000\n350\t      - ~73.5\n351\t      - ~65.2\n352\t      - ~-8.3\n353\t      - Vanilla +2.3pp (saturation)\n354\t  figures_description:\n355\t  - 未执行——在Discussion中用text argument代替。如果需要视觉，可画extrapolation curve with uncertainty\n356\t    band showing gap不converge to zero。\n357\t  analysis: Best档下这个experiment是planned but unnecessary——scale-up-data (2500) already\n358\t    shows the trend is flat for gap closure. Reviewers会accept 'the 9pp gap is maintained\n359\t    at 5× scale with no convergence trend, and ALFWorld's 134-task ceiling makes further\n360\t    scaling uninformative' without requiring the full 25K run. 在paper中放Discussion一段即可。\n361\t- name: Recovery Prompting (Few-Shot In-Context)\n362\t  plan_id: recovery-prompting\n363\t  description: 给模型提供in-context recovery examples（few-shot prompting），测试是否能elicit recovery能力。如果few-shot\n364\t    works但fine-tuning doesn't，说明knowledge exists in the base model但training signal\n365\t    corrupts it。\n366\t  expected_results:\n367\t    vanilla_with_recovery_prompt_rate: 66.0\n368\t    taxei_with_recovery_prompt_rate: 61.7\n369\t    random_with_recovery_prompt_rate: 63.8\n370\t    vanilla_base_recovery_rate: 61.7\n371\t    improvement_from_prompting_vanilla_pp: 4.3\n372\t    improvement_from_prompting_taxei_pp: 2.1\n373\t    improvement_from_prompting_random_pp: 0.0\n374\t    few_shot_detection_rate: 0.12\n375\t    prompt_design: 3 recovery exemplars showing error→detect→recover sequence\n376\t  result_rationale: 在best档下，few-shot recovery prompting shows modest improvement（+2-4pp）但远不及expected\n377\t    if recovery knowledge were latent。逻辑：(1) Base model（Qwen3-8B）确实有一些在pre-training中获得的generic\n378\t    error tolerance（vanilla本身61.7% recovery despite no injection training），few-shot可以slightly\n379\t    activate这个latent ability; (2) 但improvement modest因为embodied planning的error recovery是unbounded（需要re-plan\n380\t    entire sequence），不像tool-use那样有finite retry space——3个exemplar不能cover combinatorial\n381\t    space; (3) TaxEI-trained model从prompting获益更少（+2.1pp vs +4.3pp for vanilla），因为fine-tuning已经partially\n382\t    corrupted the base model's latent planning ability; (4) Detection rate从0%提升到12%说明explicit\n383\t    prompting can activate some meta-cognition，但这是surface-level mimicry不是true error\n384\t    awareness。这个result在best档下被framed为supplementary evidence：'even explicit in-context\n385\t    guidance cannot overcome the fundamental unbounded-recovery-space problem in embodied\n386\t    planning'。\n387\t  tables:\n388\t  - title: 'Table: Recovery Prompting Ablation (seed=42)'\n389\t    columns:\n390\t    - Condition\n391\t    - Base_Recovery\n392\t    - +3-shot Recovery\n393\t    - Improvement_pp\n394\t    - Detection_Rate\n395\t    rows:\n396\t    - - Vanilla\n397\t      - 61.7\n398\t      - 66.0\n399\t      - 4.3\n400\t      - 0.12\n401\t    - - TaxEI\n402\t      - 59.6\n403\t      - 61.7\n404\t      - 2.1\n405\t      - 0.08\n406\t    - - Random\n407\t      - 63.8\n408\t      - 63.8\n409\t      - 0.0\n410\t      - 0.04\n411\t  figures_description:\n412\t  - 'Paired bar chart: each condition shows base vs prompted recovery rate. Modest\n413\t    gains for Vanilla, minimal for TaxEI/Random. Annotation: ''Prompting cannot compensate\n414\t    for training corruption (TaxEI) or overcome structural recovery limits (all).'''\n415\t  analysis: 'Recovery prompting在best档下提供complementary evidence for the task-structure\n416\t    hypothesis。Key insight chain: (1) Detection=0% without prompting → no emergent\n417\t    error awareness from training; (2) Detection=12% with prompting → base model has\n418\t    latent capability that training didn''t activate; (3) Recovery improvement modest\n419\t    (+4pp max) → error awareness alone insufficient when recovery requires unbounded\n420\t    re-planning; (4) TaxEI benefits least → injection training actively degrades the\n421\t    base model''s latent planning ability. 这在paper中是一个clean paragraph supporting ''the\n422\t    failure is structural not methodological''。Priority 3 because it''s supplementary——the\n423\t    main story stands without it。'\n424\t- name: Per-Operator Deep Dive (Multi-Seed Validation)\n425\t  plan_id: per-operator-deepdive\n426\t  description: 多seed per-operator recovery分析，验证C4(local) advantage和C1/P2(global) disadvantage的pattern是否robust。\n427\t  expected_results:\n428\t    C4_observation_masking_taxei_advantage_mean_pp: 4.2\n429\t    C4_advantage_direction_consistent_seeds: 4\n430\t    C4_advantage_direction_consistent_out_of: 5\n431\t    P2_sub_goal_deletion_taxei_disadvantage_mean_pp: -9.8\n432\t    P2_disadvantage_direction_consistent_seeds: 4\n433\t    P2_disadvantage_direction_consistent_out_of: 5\n434\t    C1_context_truncation_taxei_disadvantage_mean_pp: -5.4\n435\t    P1_step_order_swap_neutral_mean_pp: -1.2\n436\t    pooled_N_per_operator: 60\n437\t    fisher_exact_C4_p: 0.38\n438\t    fisher_exact_P2_p: 0.18\n439\t    local_vs_global_pattern_consistent: true\n440\t  result_rationale: 在best档下，per-operator pattern以方向一致性replicate但individual tests仍NS。逻辑：(1)\n441\t    C4 (observation masking) 是最local的perturbation——单个observation被mask，model只需要'ignore\n442\t    missing info and proceed'，这与TaxEI训练中exposure to masked observations的经验对齐，所以TaxEI能show\n443\t    modest advantage (+4.2pp pooled); (2) P2 (sub-goal deletion) 是最global的——删除sub-goal后整个downstream\n444\t    plan invalid，需要full re-planning，TaxEI训练中虽然见过P2 patterns但学到的是'execute corrupted\n445\t    plan'而非'detect missing goal and re-plan'，所以显著disadvantage (-9.8pp pooled); (3)\n446\t    C1 (context truncation) 类似P2——truncated context导致cascading wrong assumptions;\n447\t    (4) P1 (step order swap) 效果neutral因为swapped steps有时accidentally correct（ALFWorld很多task的step\n448\t    order有flexibility），所以injection训练对P1的effect被task structure的flexibility抵消。5-seed\n449\t    pooled到N=60/operator后方向一致但Fisher仍NS because每个operator只有12 tasks/seed，5×12=60仍然underpowered\n450\t    for moderate effect sizes。Best档下reviewers接受这个pattern作为hypothesis-generating evidence配合clear\n451\t    theoretical motivation（local=learnable, global=not learnable）。\n452\t  tables:\n453\t  - title: 'Table: Per-Operator TaxEI Advantage (5-seed pooled, N=55-60 per operator)'\n454\t    columns:\n455\t    - Operator\n456\t    - Locality\n457\t    - Vanilla_Rate\n458\t    - TaxEI_Rate\n459\t    - Δ_pp\n460\t    - Direction_Consistent_Seeds\n461\t    - Fisher_p\n462\t    rows:\n463\t    - - C4_observation_masking\n464\t      - Local\n465\t      - 0.618\n466\t      - 0.655\n467\t      - 3.7\n468\t      - 4/5\n469\t      - 0.38\n470\t    - - P1_step_order_swap\n471\t      - Mixed\n472\t      - 0.617\n473\t      - 0.6\n474\t      - -1.7\n475\t      - 3/5\n476\t      - 0.82\n477\t    - - C1_context_truncation\n478\t      - Global\n479\t      - 0.7\n480\t      - 0.633\n481\t      - -6.7\n482\t      - 4/5\n483\t      - 0.24\n484\t    - - P2_sub_goal_deletion\n485\t      - Global\n486\t      - 0.667\n487\t      - 0.55\n488\t      - -11.7\n489\t      - 4/5\n490\t      - 0.18\n491\t  figures_description:\n492\t  - 'Gradient bar chart: operators ordered by locality (C4→P1→C1→P2 left-to-right).\n493\t    Y-axis = TaxEI−Vanilla recovery gap. Clear visual gradient from positive (C4)\n494\t    to negative (P2). Individual seed dots overlaid showing consistency.'\n495\t  - '2×2 conceptual diagram: rows={Local, Global} × columns={Recovery feasible, Recovery\n496\t    infeasible}. C4 in (Local, Feasible) → TaxEI helps. P2 in (Global, Infeasible)\n497\t    → TaxEI hurts. Motivates the task-structure theory.'\n498\t  analysis: Per-operator deepdive在best档下被视为论文的conceptual highlight之一——它provides mechanistic\n499\t    explanation for WHY structured injection fails specifically in embodied planning。The\n500\t    local/global gradient is the micro-level instantiation of the macro-level finding\n501\t    (TaxEI fails where errors cascade). Reviewers在best档下appreciate this as 'going\n502\t    beyond reporting negative result to explaining why it's negative'。虽然individual\n503\t    operator tests are NS at any reasonable α, the monotonic gradient across all 4\n504\t    operators with consistent theoretical motivation (local→positive, global→negative)\n505\t    is accepted as convergent evidence。Paper中作为半页Analysis subsection with 1 figure。\n506\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"27e14a3a-a346-45ee-b971-8cd155586b0c","uuid":"e5bf6ba2-f788-44ff-9338-fce81f2551fa","timestamp":"2026-05-16T16:10:08.689Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_2/projects/tax_error_inject_agent/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T153939/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 原始framing完全成立——'Structured error injection is fundamentally destabilizing\n  for embodied planning across architectures'。论文贡献从negative result升级为positive finding\n  about injection stability properties。重点：(1)跨模型SD ratio 4:1证明是structured patterns的内在属性；(2)dose-response\n  inverted-U揭示conflicting signal mechanism；(3)recovery=resilience是对整个error-injection-for-recovery范式的conceptual\n  challenge。无需调整claims强度。\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Recovery Eval Multi-Seed (5-seed × 3 conditions)\n  plan_id: recovery-eval-multiseed\n  description: 对Vanilla/TaxEI/Random全部5个seed运行recovery eval（injected error条件下47 tasks），验证recovery≈resilience假说跨seed稳健性，并确认per-operator\n    pattern方向一致性\n  expected_results:\n    vanilla_recovery_mean: 66.1\n    vanilla_recovery_sd: 5.4\n    vanilla_recovery_seeds:\n    - 61.7\n    - 68.1\n    - 66.0\n    - 66.0\n    - 74.5\n    taxei_recovery_mean: 57.1\n    taxei_recovery_sd: 6.8\n    taxei_recovery_seeds:\n    - 59.6\n    - 46.8\n    - 61.7\n    - 61.7\n    - 57.4\n    random_recovery_mean: 57.9\n    random_recovery_sd: 7.2\n    random_recovery_seeds:\n    - 63.8\n    - 55.3\n    - 66.0\n    - 51.1\n    - 53.2\n    detection_rate_all: 0.0\n    recovery_vs_clean_gap_vanilla_pp: 1.2\n    recovery_vs_clean_gap_taxei_pp: 1.2\n    recovery_vs_clean_gap_random_pp: 0.4\n    per_operator_C4_advantage_replication: 3\n    per_operator_C4_advantage_out_of: 5\n    cohens_d_vanilla_vs_taxei_recovery: 1.42\n  result_rationale: 在best档位下，recovery=resilience pattern跨seed完全复现。逻辑：如果模型只是passively\n    ignore perturbation而非actively recover，那么recovery rate应该tracking clean eval rate而非独立变化。5-seed数据将使recovery-clean\n    gap压缩到1-2pp以内（在noise范围内），因为每个seed的recovery rate本质上就是该seed对应checkpoint的task completion\n    ability在稍有噪声的eval条件下的测量值。Detection rate保持0%说明没有任何training regime instill error\n    awareness。TaxEI的recovery variance同样高（SD~6.8pp），mirror其clean eval的instability——进一步证明recovery\n    performance完全由base task competence驱动，而非error-specific learning。Vanilla recovery\n    mean（66.1%）vs clean mean（67.3%）gap仅1.2pp，在47-task的McNemar误差范围内。\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: 5-Seed Recovery Rate vs Clean Success Rate'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Clean_Mean\n    - Recovery_Mean\n    - Gap_pp\n    - Detection_Rate\n    - Recovery_SD\n    rows:\n    - - Vanilla\n      - 67.3\n      - 66.1\n      - -1.2\n      - 0.0\n      - 5.4\n    - - TaxEI\n      - 58.3\n      - 57.1\n      - -1.2\n      - 0.0\n      - 6.8\n    - - Random\n      - 58.3\n      - 57.9\n      - -0.4\n      - 0.0\n      - 7.2\n  - title: 'Table: Per-Operator Recovery Advantage (5-seed pooled, 235 episodes)'\n    columns:\n    - Operator\n    - Vanilla_Rate\n    - TaxEI_Rate\n    - Random_Rate\n    - TaxEI_Advantage_pp\n    rows:\n    - - C4_observation_masking\n      - 0.618\n      - 0.655\n      - 0.6\n      - 3.7\n    - - P1_step_order_swap\n      - 0.617\n      - 0.6\n      - 0.6\n      - -1.7\n    - - C1_context_truncation\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.633\n      - 0.65\n      - -6.7\n    - - P2_sub_goal_deletion\n      - 0.667\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.583\n      - -11.7\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter plot: x=clean success rate per seed, y=recovery rate per seed. Three\n    colors for V/T/R. 应落在y=x对角线附近（r²>0.92），视觉上证明recovery=f(competence)而非recovery=f(training_method)'\n  - 'Per-operator heatmap: rows=4 operators, columns=5 seeds, cell color=TaxEI recovery\n    rate. C4行uniformly lighter（higher），P2行darker（lower），跨seed一致'\n  analysis: 5-seed recovery data将recovery=resilience从single-seed exploratory observation提升为robust\n    empirical finding。关键统计：paired correlation between clean rate and recovery rate\n    r=0.96 (p<0.001, N=15 seed-condition pairs)。这是对整个error-injection-for-recovery\n    paradigm的conceptual challenge——在embodied planning中，'recovery from errors'根本不存在作为独立能力，它就是task\n    competence本身。Per-operator方向性（C4 local advantage, P2 global disadvantage）在5-seed\n    pooled data中达到suggestive consistency（3/5 seeds方向一致），虽然per-seed仍由±1 task驱动，但pooled\n    N=55-60 per operator使pattern更credible。\n- name: LLaMA-3.1-8B Cross-Model Replication\n  plan_id: llama-cross-model\n  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct 3-seed完整replication（Vanilla/TaxEI/Random），验证structured\n    injection instability是跨架构通用现象而非Qwen-specific\n  expected_results:\n    llama_vanilla_recovery_mean: 73.1\n    llama_vanilla_recovery_sd: 2.5\n    llama_vanilla_recovery_seeds:\n    - 74.5\n    - 74.5\n    - 70.2\n    llama_taxei_recovery_mean: 69.5\n    llama_taxei_recovery_sd: 8.6\n    llama_taxei_recovery_seeds:\n    - 74.5\n    - 74.5\n    - 59.6\n    llama_random_recovery_mean: 76.6\n    llama_random_recovery_sd: 2.1\n    llama_random_recovery_seeds:\n    - 74.5\n    - 76.6\n    - 78.7\n    llama_vanilla_clean_mean: 72.3\n    llama_vanilla_clean_sd: 0.0\n    llama_taxei_clean_mean: 71.6\n    llama_taxei_clean_sd: 8.6\n    llama_random_clean_mean: 75.9\n    llama_random_clean_sd: 1.2\n    cross_model_taxei_sd_ratio: 4.1\n    catastrophic_seed_fraction_llama: 0.33\n    taxei_vs_random_sd_ratio: 4.1\n    llama_detection_rate_mean: 0.27\n  result_rationale: 'Best档核心：cross_model_taxei_sd_ratio在[3.5, 4.5]范围内，实际值4.1（TaxEI\n    SD 8.6 / Random SD 2.1）。这个4:1的SD ratio是structured injection创造training instability的直接evidence。为什么会出现：(1)\n    Structured patterns（taxonomy-labeled perturbations）在loss landscape中创造systematic偏移方向，某些seed的初始化恰好与这些bias方向对齐导致catastrophic\n    amplification；(2) Random perturbations平均化为near-zero gradient bias，任何seed都不会被systematically\n    pushed toward failure region。LLaMA s123 collapse（recovery 59.6% vs vanilla 70.2%）mirrors\n    Qwen的consistent degradation pattern但以higher variance形式表现——不同architecture对structured\n    bias的响应mode不同（Qwen: uniform moderate harm; LLaMA: bimodal all-or-nothing），但direction一致。LLaMA的非零detection\n    rate（~27%）是interesting但不影响core story：LLaMA base model本身就有更强的meta-cognitive tendency（可能来自RLHF\n    alignment），这不是training regime effect而是base model property。'\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Cross-Model Comparison — Training Stability'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Condition\n    - Mean_Recovery\n    - SD\n    - Catastrophic_Seeds\n    - SD_Ratio_vs_Random\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - TaxEI\n      - 58.3\n      - 6.5\n      - 1/5 (20%)\n      - 0.75×\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - Random\n      - 58.3\n      - 8.7\n      - 1/5 (20%)\n      - 1.0×\n    - - LLaMA-3.1-8B\n      - TaxEI\n      - 69.5\n      - 8.6\n      - 1/3 (33%)\n      - 4.1×\n    - - LLaMA-3.1-8B\n      - Random\n      - 76.6\n      - 2.1\n      - 0/3 (0%)\n      - 1.0×\n  - title: 'Table: LLaMA Per-Seed Results'\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - Vanilla_Recovery\n    - TaxEI_Recovery\n    - Random_Recovery\n    - TaxEI_Δ_vs_Vanilla\n    rows:\n    - - s42\n      - 74.5\n      - 74.5\n      - 76.6\n      - 0.0\n    - - s0\n      - 74.5\n      - 74.5\n      - 74.5\n      - 0.0\n    - - s123\n      - 70.2\n      - 59.6\n      - 78.7\n      - -10.6\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Dual-panel bar chart: Left=Qwen, Right=LLaMA. Each panel shows V/T/R means with\n    individual seed dots overlaid. Error bars = SD. 视觉上highlight TaxEI的wide spread\n    vs Random的tight cluster'\n  - 'SD ratio comparison: grouped bar chart showing TaxEI_SD/Random_SD for both models.\n    Both bars near 4:1 height ratio. Horizontal dashed line at 1.0 (equal stability)'\n  analysis: 'Cross-model replication是从Borderline Accept升级到Findings Accept的关键evidence。Reviewers最大concern是''maybe\n    it''s just Qwen''——3-seed LLaMA data以方向一致性（而非absolute power）回答这个问题。SD ratio 4.1:1在best档下被接受为sufficient\n    evidence because: (1) direction完全一致——两个模型都是TaxEI unstable, Random stable; (2)\n    具体failure mode不同但可解释——Qwen对structured bias更uniformly susceptible（可能因为较弱的pre-training\n    robustness），LLaMA有stronger base但occasional catastrophic collapse（bimodal response\n    to structured bias）; (3) 3-seed × 2-model = 6 independent TaxEI training runs中2个catastrophic（33%），vs\n    6 Random runs中0个catastrophic（0%）——这个0-vs-2 pattern本身有practical significance even\n    without formal power。'\n- name: Scale-Up Data (500→2500 Trajectories)\n  plan_id: scale-up-data\n  description: 将训练数据从501 successful trajectories扩展到~2500，测试TaxEI failure是否由数据规模不足导致。3-seed\n    V+T比较。\n  expected_results:\n    collection_success_rate: 0.7\n    total_trajectories_collected: 2487\n    api_cost_usd: 44.5\n    scaled_vanilla_mean: 71.2\n    scaled_vanilla_sd: 3.8\n    scaled_vanilla_seeds:\n    - 69.8\n    - 74.5\n    - 69.4\n    scaled_taxei_mean: 62.3\n    scaled_taxei_sd: 7.4\n    scaled_taxei_seeds:\n    - 66.0\n    - 55.3\n    - 65.5\n    vanilla_improvement_vs_500: 3.9\n    taxei_improvement_vs_500: 5.6\n    taxei_vanilla_gap_pp: -8.9\n    taxei_sd_still_elevated: true\n    catastrophic_seed_present: true\n  result_rationale: 在best档下，scale-up证明data volume不是瓶颈。逻辑：(1) Vanilla从67.3%→71.2%（+3.9pp），shows正常data\n    scaling behavior——更多clean data mildly improves task completion; (2) TaxEI也改善，从58.3%→62.3%（+5.6pp，slightly\n    larger margin），但gap仍然是~9pp（在[8,10]范围内）且SD仍elevated（7.4pp vs 3.8pp）; (3) 1/3 seed仍然shows\n    catastrophic behavior（55.3%），证明instability is not a small-data artifact。为什么gap维持：ALFWorld只有~134\n    unique tasks，即使trajectories增加到2500也只是~19/task的重复，无法提供真正的novel task diversity。Structured\n    error patterns在任何data scale下都创造conflicting signals（正确action distribution vs injected\n    error distribution的systematic conflict），不会被averaging out因为taxonomy labels是deterministic\n    not stochastic。这与PALADIN的50K trajectories有qualitative difference：PALADIN的diversity来自thousands\n    of distinct tools/APIs，而ALFWorld diversity ceiling很低。\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Data Scale Ablation (3-seed)'\n    columns:\n    - Scale\n    - Condition\n    - Mean\n    - SD\n    - Gap_vs_Vanilla\n    - Catastrophic_Seeds\n    rows:\n    - - 500 traj (baseline)\n      - Vanilla\n      - 67.3\n      - 4.7\n      - —\n      - 0/5\n    - - 500 traj (baseline)\n      - TaxEI\n      - 58.3\n      - 6.5\n      - -9.0\n      - 1/5\n    - - 2500 traj\n      - Vanilla\n      - 71.2\n      - 3.8\n      - —\n      - 0/3\n    - - 2500 traj\n      - TaxEI\n      - 62.3\n      - 7.4\n      - -8.9\n      - 1/3\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: x=data scale (500, 2500), y=mean accuracy. Two lines (Vanilla solid,\n    TaxEI dashed). Both rise but gap constant ~9pp. Shaded region = ±1 SD. TaxEI shading\n    notably wider.'\n  analysis: Scale ablation在best档下提供clean negative result：more data helps both conditions\n    proportionally但不关闭gap。这strengthens task-structure hypothesis over data-insufficiency\n    explanation。关键framing：'Within ALFWorld's diversity ceiling (~134 unique tasks),\n    5× data scaling improves absolute performance but does not resolve the structured\n    injection instability, suggesting the failure mechanism is signal-level (conflicting\n    gradients) rather than sample-level (insufficient coverage).' Paper中作为1段Discussion\n    evidence，不需要占main results space。\n- name: Scale Ablation (25K-50K Trajectories)\n  plan_id: scale-ablation\n  description: 假设性的extreme scale experiment——将data规模推到PALADIN级别（25K-50K trajectories）。在best档下，这个experiment如果执行会进一步confirm\n    scale is not the fix。\n  expected_results:\n    trajectories_needed: 25000\n    estimated_api_cost_usd: 250\n    estimated_gpu_hours: 40\n    vanilla_projected_mean: 73.5\n    taxei_projected_mean: 65.2\n    gap_still_present_pp: -8.3\n    taxei_sd_still_elevated: true\n    practical_ceiling_note: ALFWorld only has 134 unique tasks; beyond ~5K trajectories,\n      marginal returns diminish sharply\n  result_rationale: 在best档下，即使25K scale也不会close the gap，因为bottleneck是task diversity（134\n    unique tasks）而非trajectory count。当每个task有~187个trajectory variants时，model只是在memorize同一task的不同表述，而structured\n    injection的conflicting signal per-task-template不会被additional examples resolve。这是best档而非worst档的预测——reviewers接受'we\n    tested 2500 and the trend is clear, 25K is infeasible given ALFWorld constraints\n    but would not help based on the non-convergence pattern'作为sufficient evidence。不需要actually\n    run这个experiment——scale-up-data已经demonstrate the trend。\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Projected Scale-Performance Curve (extrapolation)'\n    columns:\n    - Scale\n    - Vanilla_Proj\n    - TaxEI_Proj\n    - Gap_pp\n    - Diminishing_Returns\n    rows:\n    - - 500\n      - 67.3\n      - 58.3\n      - -9.0\n      - —\n    - - 2500\n      - 71.2\n      - 62.3\n      - -8.9\n      - Vanilla +3.9pp\n    - - 25000\n      - ~73.5\n      - ~65.2\n      - ~-8.3\n      - Vanilla +2.3pp (saturation)\n  figures_description:\n  - 未执行——在Discussion中用text argument代替。如果需要视觉，可画extrapolation curve with uncertainty\n    band showing gap不converge to zero。\n  analysis: Best档下这个experiment是planned but unnecessary——scale-up-data (2500) already\n    shows the trend is flat for gap closure. Reviewers会accept 'the 9pp gap is maintained\n    at 5× scale with no convergence trend, and ALFWorld's 134-task ceiling makes further\n    scaling uninformative' without requiring the full 25K run. 在paper中放Discussion一段即可。\n- name: Recovery Prompting (Few-Shot In-Context)\n  plan_id: recovery-prompting\n  description: 给模型提供in-context recovery examples（few-shot prompting），测试是否能elicit recovery能力。如果few-shot\n    works但fine-tuning doesn't，说明knowledge exists in the base model但training signal\n    corrupts it。\n  expected_results:\n    vanilla_with_recovery_prompt_rate: 66.0\n    taxei_with_recovery_prompt_rate: 61.7\n    random_with_recovery_prompt_rate: 63.8\n    vanilla_base_recovery_rate: 61.7\n    improvement_from_prompting_vanilla_pp: 4.3\n    improvement_from_prompting_taxei_pp: 2.1\n    improvement_from_prompting_random_pp: 0.0\n    few_shot_detection_rate: 0.12\n    prompt_design: 3 recovery exemplars showing error→detect→recover sequence\n  result_rationale: 在best档下，few-shot recovery prompting shows modest improvement（+2-4pp）但远不及expected\n    if recovery knowledge were latent。逻辑：(1) Base model（Qwen3-8B）确实有一些在pre-training中获得的generic\n    error tolerance（vanilla本身61.7% recovery despite no injection training），few-shot可以slightly\n    activate这个latent ability; (2) 但improvement modest因为embodied planning的error recovery是unbounded（需要re-plan\n    entire sequence），不像tool-use那样有finite retry space——3个exemplar不能cover combinatorial\n    space; (3) TaxEI-trained model从prompting获益更少（+2.1pp vs +4.3pp for vanilla），因为fine-tuning已经partially\n    corrupted the base model's latent planning ability; (4) Detection rate从0%提升到12%说明explicit\n    prompting can activate some meta-cognition，但这是surface-level mimicry不是true error\n    awareness。这个result在best档下被framed为supplementary evidence：'even explicit in-context\n    guidance cannot overcome the fundamental unbounded-recovery-space problem in embodied\n    planning'。\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Recovery Prompting Ablation (seed=42)'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Base_Recovery\n    - +3-shot Recovery\n    - Improvement_pp\n    - Detection_Rate\n    rows:\n    - - Vanilla\n      - 61.7\n      - 66.0\n      - 4.3\n      - 0.12\n    - - TaxEI\n      - 59.6\n      - 61.7\n      - 2.1\n      - 0.08\n    - - Random\n      - 63.8\n      - 63.8\n      - 0.0\n      - 0.04\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired bar chart: each condition shows base vs prompted recovery rate. Modest\n    gains for Vanilla, minimal for TaxEI/Random. Annotation: ''Prompting cannot compensate\n    for training corruption (TaxEI) or overcome structural recovery limits (all).'''\n  analysis: 'Recovery prompting在best档下提供complementary evidence for the task-structure\n    hypothesis。Key insight chain: (1) Detection=0% without prompting → no emergent\n    error awareness from training; (2) Detection=12% with prompting → base model has\n    latent capability that training didn''t activate; (3) Recovery improvement modest\n    (+4pp max) → error awareness alone insufficient when recovery requires unbounded\n    re-planning; (4) TaxEI benefits least → injection training actively degrades the\n    base model''s latent planning ability. 这在paper中是一个clean paragraph supporting ''the\n    failure is structural not methodological''。Priority 3 because it''s supplementary——the\n    main story stands without it。'\n- name: Per-Operator Deep Dive (Multi-Seed Validation)\n  plan_id: per-operator-deepdive\n  description: 多seed per-operator recovery分析，验证C4(local) advantage和C1/P2(global) disadvantage的pattern是否robust。\n  expected_results:\n    C4_observation_masking_taxei_advantage_mean_pp: 4.2\n    C4_advantage_direction_consistent_seeds: 4\n    C4_advantage_direction_consistent_out_of: 5\n    P2_sub_goal_deletion_taxei_disadvantage_mean_pp: -9.8\n    P2_disadvantage_direction_consistent_seeds: 4\n    P2_disadvantage_direction_consistent_out_of: 5\n    C1_context_truncation_taxei_disadvantage_mean_pp: -5.4\n    P1_step_order_swap_neutral_mean_pp: -1.2\n    pooled_N_per_operator: 60\n    fisher_exact_C4_p: 0.38\n    fisher_exact_P2_p: 0.18\n    local_vs_global_pattern_consistent: true\n  result_rationale: 在best档下，per-operator pattern以方向一致性replicate但individual tests仍NS。逻辑：(1)\n    C4 (observation masking) 是最local的perturbation——单个observation被mask，model只需要'ignore\n    missing info and proceed'，这与TaxEI训练中exposure to masked observations的经验对齐，所以TaxEI能show\n    modest advantage (+4.2pp pooled); (2) P2 (sub-goal deletion) 是最global的——删除sub-goal后整个downstream\n    plan invalid，需要full re-planning，TaxEI训练中虽然见过P2 patterns但学到的是'execute corrupted\n    plan'而非'detect missing goal and re-plan'，所以显著disadvantage (-9.8pp pooled); (3)\n    C1 (context truncation) 类似P2——truncated context导致cascading wrong assumptions;\n    (4) P1 (step order swap) 效果neutral因为swapped steps有时accidentally correct（ALFWorld很多task的step\n    order有flexibility），所以injection训练对P1的effect被task structure的flexibility抵消。5-seed\n    pooled到N=60/operator后方向一致但Fisher仍NS because每个operator只有12 tasks/seed，5×12=60仍然underpowered\n    for moderate effect sizes。Best档下reviewers接受这个pattern作为hypothesis-generating evidence配合clear\n    theoretical motivation（local=learnable, global=not learnable）。\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Per-Operator TaxEI Advantage (5-seed pooled, N=55-60 per operator)'\n    columns:\n    - Operator\n    - Locality\n    - Vanilla_Rate\n    - TaxEI_Rate\n    - Δ_pp\n    - Direction_Consistent_Seeds\n    - Fisher_p\n    rows:\n    - - C4_observation_masking\n      - Local\n      - 0.618\n      - 0.655\n      - 3.7\n      - 4/5\n      - 0.38\n    - - P1_step_order_swap\n      - Mixed\n      - 0.617\n      - 0.6\n      - -1.7\n      - 3/5\n      - 0.82\n    - - C1_context_truncation\n      - Global\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.633\n      - -6.7\n      - 4/5\n      - 0.24\n    - - P2_sub_goal_deletion\n      - Global\n      - 0.667\n      - 0.55\n      - -11.7\n      - 4/5\n      - 0.18\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Gradient bar chart: operators ordered by locality (C4→P1→C1→P2 left-to-right).\n    Y-axis = TaxEI−Vanilla recovery gap. Clear visual gradient from positive (C4)\n    to negative (P2). Individual seed dots overlaid showing consistency.'\n  - '2×2 conceptual diagram: rows={Local, Global} × columns={Recovery feasible, Recovery\n    infeasible}. C4 in (Local, Feasible) → TaxEI helps. P2 in (Global, Infeasible)\n    → TaxEI hurts. Motivates the task-structure theory.'\n  analysis: Per-operator deepdive在best档下被视为论文的conceptual highlight之一——它provides mechanistic\n    explanation for WHY structured injection fails specifically in embodied planning。The\n    local/global gradient is the micro-level instantiation of the macro-level finding\n    (TaxEI fails where errors cascade). Reviewers在best档下appreciate this as 'going\n    beyond reporting negative result to explaining why it's negative'。虽然individual\n    operator tests are NS at any reasonable α, the monotonic gradient across all 4\n    operators with consistent theoretical motivation (local→positive, global→negative)\n    is accepted as convergent evidence。Paper中作为半页Analysis subsection with 1 figure。\n","numLines":506,"startLine":1,"totalLines":506}}}
